<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body>
  <h1>US PPO Discovery Training (candidate)</h1>
  <p>Version: {{ version }} | Promoted: {{ promoted }}</p>
  <p>Universe snapshot: {{ snapshot_sha256 }}</p>
  <p>Training seed: 42</p>
  <p>Cost contract: IBKR Singapore Tiered costs at $10,000 training capital; execution remains Alpaca.</p>
  <p>Survivorship bias: today's roster was applied historically. Promotion is manual: test CAGR &gt; 12% and, if an incumbent exists, both test CAGR and test Sharpe must strictly beat that incumbent.</p>
  {% if failure_reasons %}
    <p>Failure reasons:</p>
    <ul>
      {% for reason in failure_reasons %}
      <li>{{ reason }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  {% endif %}
  {% if evaluation %}
    <p>Selected seed: {{ evaluation.get('selected_seed') }} | Device: {{ evaluation.get('device') }}</p>
    <p>Test CAGR: {{ evaluation.get('test_cagr') }} | Test Sharpe: {{ evaluation.get('test_sharpe') }} | Max drawdown: {{ evaluation.get('test_max_drawdown') }}</p>
    {% set diag = (evaluation.get('portfolio_diagnostics') or {}).get('summary') %}
    {% if diag %}
    <h2>Portfolio diagnostics</h2>
    <p>Mean turnover: {{ diag.get('mean_turnover') }} | Mean cost bps: {{ diag.get('mean_transaction_cost_bps') }} | Mean replacement fraction: {{ diag.get('mean_replacement_fraction') }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}
  <p>{{ para_1_overall }}</p>
  <p>{{ para_2_metrics }}</p>
  <p>{{ para_3_recommendations }}</p>
</body>
</html>
